              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma we kimiiko kimikali omwami owe Misiri aafwa. Baisiraeli baba balila khulwe kimilimo kiabwe kimisiro. Benya buyeeti mala khulila khwabwe khwolela Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.23",
